{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kooler D2 - API completa (auth, actividades, asistencia, certificados, resenas e historial)",
    "_postman_id": "kooler-d2-persona-n",
    "description": "Coleccion D2 del backend Kooler. Cubre las 3 funcionalidades y el flujo completo en orden.\n\nRequisitos: `docker compose up -d` y `npm run start:dev` en `backend/`.\nSeeds demo: organizador@icesi.edu.co y estudiante@icesi.edu.co / Password123!\n\nLos tokens e identificadores se guardan solos: al ejecutar los requests en orden,\n`orgToken`, `studentToken`, `activityId`, `sessionId` y `certificateId` quedan\ndisponibles como variables de coleccion.\n\nPara probar el despliegue cambie `baseUrl` por `{{prodUrl}}` (Render).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api",
      "description": "Backend local"
    },
    {
      "key": "orgToken",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Se guarda al ejecutar \"2. Login organizador\""
    },
    {
      "key": "studentToken",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Se guarda al ejecutar \"5. Login estudiante\""
    },
    {
      "key": "activityId",
      "value": "1",
      "description": "Se guarda al ejecutar \"3. Crear actividad\""
    },
    {
      "key": "sessionId",
      "value": "1",
      "description": "Se guarda al ejecutar \"12. Crear sesion\""
    },
    {
      "key": "certificateId",
      "value": "1",
      "description": "Se guarda al ejecutar \"16. Mis certificados\""
    },
    {
      "key": "prodUrl",
      "value": "https://kooler-api.onrender.com/api",
      "description": "Backend desplegado en Render"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Registrar organizador",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Laura\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Organizadora\",\n  \"email\": \"organizador@icesi.edu.co\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\",\n  \"roleName\": \"ORGANIZADOR\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const expectedStatuses = [201,400,409];",
              "pm.test(\"Registrar organizador: estado esperado 201/400/409\", () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf(expectedStatuses);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('respuesta no vacia', () => { pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(15000); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Login organizador",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"organizador@icesi.edu.co\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123!\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const expectedStatuses = [200];",
              "pm.test(\"Login organizador: estado esperado 200\", () => {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf(expectedStatuses);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('respuesta no vacia', () => { pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(15000); });",
              "",
              "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "  try {",
              "    const body = pm.response.json();",
              "    const value = body.accessToken;",
              "    if (value !== undefined && value !== null && value !== \"\") {",
              "      pm.collectionVariables.set('orgToken', String(value));",
              "    }",
              "  } catch (error) {",
              "    // La respuesta no era JSON: no se actualiza la variable.",
              "  }",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
